For only today
-> SSR and CSR,
server side rendering, and client side rendering
in CSR --> browser first load a blank page, then render the content using JS, webpacks.
in SSR --> server sends a fully loaded HTML file to browser, which improves the SEO. 
SSG --> SSG generates the page on built time, which makes the app faster.
ISR --> allows those static pages to be updated in the background without rebuilding the entire app.
How routing works in Next.js --> Next.js uses file-based routing.
The folder structure inside the app or pages directory automatically becomes routes.
Both are used to define data structures.
interface is mainly used for object shapes and can be extended, while type is more flexible and can define unions and complex types.



